# Review

One reference, `references/review.md`, used at three moments:

- **Per change** (always before commit/PR): §"Per-change core" — scope, tests,
  docs sync, CI, temporary shims.
- **Architecture-impacting changes**: §"Architecture deep review" — boundaries,
  ownership, concurrency, error handling, reversibility.
- **Audit** (periodic or on demand): §"Output audit" — the nine recurring
  agent failure modes across recent slices.

